-- Agreed tests (verification step 2, plain SQL on PostgreSQL) for AdventureWorks2025 HumanResources.vEmployeeDepartment.
-- GENERATED by npm run agreed-tests -- --object HumanResources.vEmployeeDepartment. Do not edit by hand: change the fixed cases
-- in the object's spec, recapture, and review tests/AdventureWorks2025/HumanResources.vEmployeeDepartment.expected.json.
-- Expected results were captured from the original T-SQL on SQL Server and are reviewed at step 5.
-- Row order is not asserted here (multiset comparison); step 3 checks order where the source guarantees one.
